flowchart LR
    U[User Consent/Action] --> IN[Chat/Meeting/Task Input]
    IN --> CLASSIFY{Sensitive?}
    CLASSIFY -- Yes --> LOCAL[Local-only: Meetily/Ollama/Manual]
    CLASSIFY -- No --> MIN[PII Minimization/Redaction]
    MIN --> AIGW[AI Gateway]
    AIGW --> API[Cloud AI API]
    AIGW --> AUDIT[(Audit + Usage Ledger)]
    API --> DRAFT[AI Draft]
    LOCAL --> DRAFT
    DRAFT --> REVIEW[Human Review]
    REVIEW --> DB[(SQL Server Official Data)]
    DB -. optional .-> QDRANT[(Qdrant Semantic Index)]
    DB --> RET[Retention/Delete Policy]
